        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a Purkinje myocyte over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The Purkinje myocyte (also known as cardiac Purkinje fiber) is part of the cardiac conduction system that receives signals from the bundle of His and innervates the ventricular cardiac muscle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cardiac Purkinje fiber development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Purkinje myocyte development</rdfs:label>
