        <obo:IAO_0000115>A microtubule-based process that results in the movement of organelles, other microtubules, or other cellular components. Examples include motor-driven movement along microtubules and movement driven by polymerization or depolymerization of microtubules.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Reactome:R-HSA-983189</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:label>microtubule-based movement</rdfs:label>
