        <obo:IAO_0000115>The increase in size or mass of an organ. Organs are commonly observed as visibly distinct structures, but may also exist as loosely associated clusters of cells that function together as to perform a specific function.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>organ growth</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
