        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which the anatomical structures of the epidermis are generated and organized. The epidermis is the outer epithelial layer of an animal, it may be a single layer that produces an extracellular material (e.g. the cuticle of arthropods) or a complex stratified squamous epithelium, as in the case of many vertebrate species.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>hypodermis morphogenesis</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>epidermis morphogenesis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
