        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001434"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A reproductive quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s initiating, sustaining, or supporting reproduction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
