        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001300"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An optical quality which obtains by virtue of the ability of the bearer to absorb visible light.</obo:IAO_0000115>
